      "text": "⚡️🇪🇬 Egyptian government media \"Al-Ahram\" publishes an article stating that Iran and the Houthis are not responsible for the drone attack in Domyat.\n\nThey cite the Houthi statement and interactions with the Iranian Foreign Ministry in their article.\n\nConsidering it is literally a government newspaper and therefore has its own censor, it seems that the official media stance is not to escalate anything with Iran considering the attack was only directed at a US asset and not any other port asset belonging to Egypt.\n\n@medmannews",
